            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Most liquid rubber products will bond to a sound, fully cured DRYLOK coating, and manufacturers often permit it. What you cannot do is the reverse: DRYLOK needs to bond chemically with bare masonry and will not hold on a rubber membrane. Check the specific product's data sheet, because compatibility varies by formulation.",
