                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-white">Bridges hairline cracks</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-green-400">Yes — stretches across them</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-red-400">No — cracks with the wall</td>
                </tr>
